            {
              "category": "未宣言の前提への依存",
              "file": "apps/cli/src/commands/track/tddd/catalogue_impl_signals.rs",
              "line": 165,
              "message": "The generated cargo shim embeds `metadata`—including `TMPDIR`-derived workspace and target paths—inside a single-quoted shell literal. A valid Unix path containing `'` terminates that literal and makes the regression test fail before exercising target exclusion. Neither the spec nor `environment-assumptions.md` declares apostrophe-free paths (its input-encoding policy remains TODO). Pass the metadata through an environment variable/file or apply shell-safe quoting.",
              "severity": "medium"
            }
          ],
